gismu-making process. I hope to be able to draw on it to create a kind of 
living version of the finprims document, and to suggest amendments to the 
description of the gismu-making process in the forthcoming edition of CLL.

If that code resurfaces, please do send it my way, or let me know where I 
might find it.

Thanks again,

